kernel/modules/jade_core/ARCHITECTURE.md
jade-tree/ARCHITECTURE.md

# Archived plans and open design questions (local reference only)
archived-plans/
open-questions/

keys/
jade.toml
.env
.env.ec2
.ec2-host
.venv/
